{"slug":"48447-monaala-chapathi","title":"ಮೋನಾಳ ಚಪಾತಿ","titleEn":"Monaala Chapathi","level":"1","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/48447-monaala-chapathi","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":48447,"authors":["Sandhya Taksale"],"illustrators":["Shailja Jain Chougule"],"translators":["Smitha sathyaprakash"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2018","originalStory":{"title":"मोना को पसंद है रोटी!"},"copyrightNotice":"'Monaala chapathi' has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಮೋನಾಳ ಚಪಾತಿ (Kannada), translated by Smitha sathyaprakash, based on original story मोना को पसंद है रोटी!, written by Sandhya Taksale, illustrated by Shailja Jain Chougule, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2018) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Girl holding roti","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":3,"title":"Girl observing dough","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":4,"title":"Woman drying wheat on a saree","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":5,"title":"Mother in the farm with daughter","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":6,"title":"Women planting the seeds","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":7,"title":"Mother and daughter talking each other","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":8,"title":"Mother making roti","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":9,"title":"A girl holding roti","illustrator":"Shailja Jain Chougule","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಅಮ್ಮಾ, ನೀನು ಈ ಚಪಾತಿ ಹೇಗೆ ಮಾಡುವೆ?”","“ ಈ ಮೆತ್ತಗಿನ ಹಿಟ್ಟಿನಿಂದ.”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಈ ಮೆತ್ತಗಿನ ಹಿಟ್ಟು ಹೇಗೆ ಮಾಡುವೆ?”","“ಈ ಬಿಳಿ ಒಣ ಹಿಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ನೀರು ಹಾಕಿ.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಹಿಟ್ಟು ಎಲ್ಲಿಂದ ಬರುತ್ತದೆ?”","“ಗೋಧಿ ಕಾಳಿನಿಂದ ಹಿಟ್ಟು ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ.”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಅಂದರೆ, ಗೋಧಿ ಕಾಳು ಎಲ್ಲಿಂದ ಬರುತ್ತವೆ ? ”","“ನಮ್ಮ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬೆಳೆಯುತ್ತೇವೆ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ನಾವು ಗೋಧಿ ಹೇಗೆ ಬೆಳೆಯುತ್ತೇವೆ?” “ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಗೋಧಿ ಬೀಜ ಬಿತ್ತುತ್ತೇವೆ. ಮಳೆಯಿಂದ ಬೀಜ ಮೊಳಕೆ ಬಂದು, ಸಸಿ ಆಗುತ್ತದೆ. ಸಸಿಗಳನ್ನು ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ನೋಡಿಕೊಳ್ಳಬೇಕು.” “ಓಹೋ, ಆಮೇಲೆ?”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಸಸಿಗಳು ದೊಡ್ಡವಾಗಿ, ಸೊಂಪಾದ ಬೆಳೆ ಕೊಡುತ್ತವೆ.”","“ಇದೆಲ್ಲ ಆದ ಮೇಲೆ?”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ನಮಗೆ ಗೋಧಿ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ. ಮತ್ತೆ, ನಮ್ಮ ಮೋನಾಗೆ ಚಪಾತಿ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ .”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/48447-monaala-chapathi/p08.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["“ಅಂತಿಂಥ ಚಪಾತಿಯಲ್ಲ!","ದುಂಡಗೆ, ಉಬ್ಬಿದ,","ಮೆ ತ್ತಗಿನ ಬಿಸಿಬಿಸಿ ಚಪಾ ತಿ. ”"]}],"wordCount":84}